# T0105 — To Do List Tabs

**Task:** T0105 (id `117`) — To Do List Tabs  
**State at plan:** `ready` · Priority: medium · Project: TaskMesh (4)  
**Branch (after approval):** `T0105-todo-list-tabs`

## Context

Project **To Do lists** tab (`ProjectDetailPage`, `tab === "todo_lists"`) currently shows list switchers as a row of **buttons** inside a card, plus a separate **input + Create list** row below.

T0105 asks for **horizontal tabs** (see task attachment): selected tab uses **theme primary/accent** text + underline; **+New** tab on the far right opens inline title entry to create a list; **double-click** a tab to rename.

Kanban boards already ship a close match: `.board-tabs` / `.board-tab` with accent active state, double-click rename, `+` add tab, and × delete on **empty** boards only.

## Depends-on gate

**T0093** (*To Do list functionality enhancements*) — state **`pending`** (parent work done; does not block). Proceed.

## Size / split

Single UI pass on one surface. No schema. Suitable as one worktask. No split.

## Interview (confirmed)

| Topic | Decision |
|-------|----------|
| Surfaces | **Project To Do tab only** — not global `/todos` |
| Tab pattern | **Match Kanban `.board-tabs`** — accent underline, double-click rename, +New on the right; **no drag-reorder** |
| List numbers | **On hover only** — `title` attribute / tooltip shows `L####`; tab label is title only |
| Delete | **Empty lists only** — × on tab when list has **zero items** (Kanban empty-board pattern); confirm before delete |
| Active highlight | Theme **primary/accent** color + bottom border (existing `.board-tab.active`) |

## Goal

Replace the button row + separate create row with a **tab bar above the list view** that feels consistent with Kanban board tabs.

## Scope

**In scope**

1. **Extract or share tab UI** for project To Do lists
   - Reuse `.board-tabs` / `.board-tab` styles (may add a shared `TodoListTabs` or generalize a thin wrapper around the board-tab row pattern)
   - Tabs: title only; `title={formatEntityRef("todo_list", n)}` for hover tooltip
   - Active tab selects which list’s `TodoListView` renders below
   - Double-click → inline rename → `PATCH /api/v1/todo-lists/:id` `{ title }`

2. **+New tab** (far right, label **+New** per task — not bare `+` unless it fits visually)
   - Click toggles inline title input in the tab bar (or replaces the +New tab with an input until create/cancel)
   - Enter or blur-with-value → `POST /api/v1/todo-lists` with `projectId`; select the new tab
   - Escape / empty cancel → back to +New

3. **Delete empty list**
   - When active list detail has **0 items**, show × on that tab (fetch item count from list query or tab metadata)
   - Confirm dialog; `DELETE /api/v1/todo-lists/:id`; select another list if the active one was deleted

4. **Layout cleanup**
   - Remove the “Project To Do lists” card wrapper / button row / separate create row
   - Tab bar sits directly above `TodoListView` (still in project tab content area)

**Out of scope**

- Global `/todos` page / middle nav
- Tab drag-reorder
- Schema / API changes (rename + delete already exist)
- Inbox semantics (project lists are `kind: "list"` only)

## Implementation outline

1. Add `TodoListTabBar` component (or adapt board-tab subcomponents) under `client/src/components/` — props: lists, activeId, onSelect, onCreate, onRename, onDeleteEmpty, itemCounts or list details for empty check.
2. Wire in `ProjectDetailPage` todo_lists section — replace lines ~734–768 card/button/create UI with tab bar + `TodoListView`.
3. CSS: reuse `.board-tabs`; add `.board-tab--add` variant text **+New** if needed; ensure accent active state uses `var(--accent)`.
4. Invalidate `["todo-lists", projectId]` and `["todo-list", listId]` on create/rename/delete.

No Drizzle migration.

## Acceptance

- Project To Do tab shows horizontal tabs; selected tab has accent text + underline.
- Hovering a tab shows list number (L####) without cluttering the label.
- +New on the right creates a list from inline input and selects it.
- Double-click renames a tab (PATCH).
- Empty lists show ×; delete with confirm; non-empty lists have no delete on the tab.
- List view below switches with the active tab.
- QA checklist at end of implement pass.

